        <h2 id="about-title">About me</h2>
        <p>I’m a software engineer from Sarajevo. Curiosity about how things work turned into a career building systems that scale, and then into leading teams and shaping the architecture of platforms that businesses depend on.</p>
        <p>I like owning a system end to end: architecture and system design, then implementation, deployment, and production support, and improving it once it’s live. Most of that work has been with cross-functional teams in distributed organizations, and lately it has meant bringing AI into how those teams deliver.</p>
        <dl class="about-facts">
          <div class="about-facts-lead">
            <dt>AI engineering</dt>
            <dd>At Symphony I introduced spec-driven development and AI-assisted workflows that raised engineering velocity by about 30% without lowering the quality bar, then built the reusable AI tooling, agent skills, and configurations that made it part of everyday development rather than one person’s habit. <a href="https://flagrm.com" rel="noopener">flagrm</a>, my open-source CLI, takes the same approach in public: AI coding agents remove feature flags while it checks the build and tests until they pass.</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Education</dt>
            <dd>M.Sc. and B.Sc. in Computer Science from the Faculty of Electrical Engineering, University of Sarajevo. My master’s thesis applied machine learning methods to cancer diagnosis; my bachelor’s covered a chatbot with social media integration for e-commerce.</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Teaching</dt>
            <dd>From 2022 to 2026 I taught there part-time alongside my engineering work, mentoring students in software engineering, Agile, Git, .NET, and Azure.</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Credentials</dt>
            <dd>I hold the <a href="https://www.credly.com/badges/3a66471c-0985-4643-8c92-6bbec9d6642b" rel="noopener">Microsoft Certified: Azure Fundamentals</a> and <a href="https://www.credly.com/badges/d105eb34-c3e3-468a-9838-5fa120b14186" rel="noopener">Claude Certified Architect (Foundations)</a> certifications, and have completed Anthropic’s <a href="https://verify.skilljar.com/c/3n284wtwjoyv" rel="noopener">Building with the Claude API</a> and <a href="https://verify.skilljar.com/c/6uotc9hhh223" rel="noopener">Claude Code in Action</a> courses.</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="about-writing">
